    "Foto aufnehmen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Take a photo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Foto auswählen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a photo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Foto oder Dokument anhängen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attach a photo or document"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frag mich etwas, zum Beispiel: „Wie wird das Wetter morgen?“": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask me something, for example: “What will the weather be like tomorrow?”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frage": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frage zum Anhang …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Question about the attachment …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freihändig": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hands-free"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freihändig: nach jeder Antwort hört die App wieder zu, bis 8 Sekunden lang nichts kommt. Ins Wort fallen: einfach losreden hält die Antwort an.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hands-free: after each answer the app listens again until nothing comes for 8 seconds. Barge in: just start talking to stop the answer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Geburtstage": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Birthdays"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gekoppelt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paired"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Geschriebene Fragen gehen raus, sobald er wieder da ist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Typed questions go out as soon as it is back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gesicht des Assistenten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Face of the assistant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gespeichert. Die Frage geht raus, sobald der Spark wieder erreichbar ist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved. The question goes out as soon as the Spark can be reached again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gespräch": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hallo, so klinge ich.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hello, this is how I sound."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hinweise, die der Spark von selbst gibt (Morgenrunde, Erinnerungen), sagt die App laut, solange sie offen ist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes the Spark gives by itself (morning briefing, reminders) are said aloud while the app is open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Höchstens %lld am Tag": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At most %lld a day"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ich finde keinen Kontakt „%@“ mit Telefonnummer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I find no contact “%@” with a phone number."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ich höre zu …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listening …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Im Panel unter Ich → iPhone-App das iPhone auch entfernen, dann gilt der Schlüssel nirgends mehr.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also remove the iPhone in the panel under Me → iPhone app, then the key works nowhere any more."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Im Panel unter Ich → iPhone-App „Dauerhaft zuhören erlauben“ einschalten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch on “Allow listening all the time” in the panel under Me → iPhone app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In dem Dokument habe ich keinen Text gefunden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I found no text in the document."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In der Erinnerungen-App eingetragen (Liste „Spark“).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Put into the Reminders app (list “Spark”)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In „Meine Dokumente“ speichern": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save to “My documents”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ins Wort fallen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barge in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
